  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#2dc26b\">现在支持 <span style=\"color:#fff\">1.20.4</span>！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ysHTfupk3Lk\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshockbyte.com%252fpartner%252fdnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/286633/description_53be4d91-93d7-4052-b05d-a85e17c04184.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"142\"></em></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">免责声明：要使用连接纹理功能，您必须安装 OptiFine、Continuity 或其他连接纹理替代模组。</span></span></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>消除玻璃和冰纹理中那些烦人的条纹，带来前所未有的清澈视野！</p>\n<p>嗨，互联网的朋友们！制作这个资源包是因为我在网上寻找简单透明的玻璃纹理包时，发现虽然这类资源包很多，但总觉得哪里不对劲。有时候颜色用错了，有时候不支持连接纹理，还有些分辨率根本不对。于是我就自己动手做了一个！</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:medium\">为什么</span><span style=\"font-size:medium\">选择</span><span style=\"font-size:medium\">这款透明玻璃包？</span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大多数玻璃包都不包含连接纹理。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>大窗户不再有“隐形墙”碰撞感。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>100% 还原原版染色玻璃的颜色。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:medium\">本包包含：</span></strong></span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>带连接纹理的透明普通玻璃（Fancy画质）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>带连接纹理的透明染色玻璃变体（Fancy画质）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>带连接纹理的着色玻璃（Fancy画质）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果您是内容创作者并希望使用本包，请将下载链接放入您的视频简介或适合您平台的任何位置。这能帮上大忙，也会让我非常开心！</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:14px\"><strong>透明玻璃包署名模板</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Clear Glass Pack by @DnatorGames (<a href=\"http://twitter.com/DnatorGames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">http://twitter.com/DnatorGames</span></a>)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>下载地址 (<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/clear-glass-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/clear-glass-pack</span></a>)</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/dnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xsB1kE5.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DnatorGames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TmTGk6S.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/dnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xEmLl9u.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\">本包主打<strong>透明玻璃</strong>搭配<strong>连接纹理功能！</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RmcJXYF.gif\" alt=\"透明玻璃动态GIF展示\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<em><strong>免责声明：要使用连接纹理功能，您必须安装 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span>。</strong></em></p>\n<hr>",
